; GitHub Packages for the @1abcdefggs scope. The token is read from the environment, never written here.
; Local: set NODE_AUTH_TOKEN to a token with read:packages (for example `gh auth token`).
; CI: the workflow passes GITHUB_TOKEN as NODE_AUTH_TOKEN.
@1abcdefggs:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
